1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,275
At the dispensing counter, you select
the patient from the queue or register.

2
00:00:04,275 --> 00:00:08,661
You search for the prescribed medication
and specify the quantity to hand over.

3
00:00:08,661 --> 00:00:13,657
Because the patient has a penicillin
allergy, a red safety alert warns against
dispensing.

4
00:00:13,657 --> 00:00:18,765
After consulting the clinician, you
confirm the clinical check and acknowledge
the decision.

5
00:00:18,765 --> 00:00:23,040
You complete the dispensing to update
stock and generate an official receipt.
